  "permitted_exceptions": [
    "1.0.21 disables every player-control capability at host and Runtime and removes five selection CALL sites; normal automation remains own-only. C4 Beta adds one execution flag-load site (explicit multiplayer risk opt-in). Two other experimental judgment features use three sites; render display uses exactly ShroudDraw/FogDraw post-initialization sites; defaults off. Render display and native aircraft waypoints are ordinary UI controls; network aircraft paths now use the ordinary event gateway without either aircraft patch; native aircraft patches are SP-only. Small-map clamp adds one manager-owned five-byte entry only when viewport bounds invert and the full remaining native body matches; existing foreign patches are preserved. All writes owned by the entry manager, callbacks acquire a bound-thread Capture lease. Explicit host polling feeds Runtime. Optional compatible ground-click suppression uses the existing common message boundary only, default off; no OutList rewriting",
